### Avro Generated ###
**/src/main/avro-generated/

# Hand-written Avro schemas are the Kafka wire contract and must be versioned.
# They live in oms-contracts and nowhere else; the rule below catches stray copies
# reappearing in a service module.
**/src/main/avro/
!oms-contracts/src/main/avro/

### Logs ###
**/logs/
oms-mcp-server/logs/spring-ai.log

### JAR Files ###
tools/*.jar

### Node ###
# Module folders have their own rules; this also catches tool caches created at the repo root.
node_modules/

### Python ###
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

### Rendered media and other binaries ###
# Manim renders (videos plus text caches) are regenerated from the .py scenes next to them.
oms-knowledge-base/animations/media/
*.mp4
*.mov
*.avi
*.mkv
*.webm
*.mp3
*.wav
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar
*.tar
*.tgz
*.tar.gz
*.exe
*.dll
*.iso

### OS files ###
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

### Spec workflow ###
# Command logs are bulky and reproducible; last-run.json (the verdict evidence) is kept.
specs/*/*/evidence/*.log
specs/*/*/.autopilot.json

